    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16094" root="رفت" body-key="r">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رفّتهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْفِيتٌ</span>, <i>He broke it</i> [app. <i>much,</i>
or <i>into many pieces</i>]: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and hence, (assumed tropical:)  <i>He dishonoured, despised,</i> or <i>condemned, him;</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْفِيتٌ</span>
being <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْقِيرٌ</span>, and <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْفِيلٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْظِيمٌ</span>. (Er-Rághib, TA. *)

